orm to U.S. Manufacturing Facility", "url": "https://investors.alnylam.com/press-release?id=29466", "publisher": "Alnylam Investor Relations", "document_date": "2025-12-17", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "primary_company_release", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "Source for Norton expansion, siRELIS, pilot-scale batches, and FDA Emerging Technology Program acceptance."}, {"source_id": "src_amvuttra_attrcm_approval", "title": "Alnylam Announces FDA Approval of AMVUTTRA for ATTR-CM", "url": "https://investors.alnylam.com/press-release?id=28831", "publisher": "Alnylam Investor Relations", "document_date": "2025-03-20", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "primary_company_release", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "Source for U.S. approval, HELIOS-B outcome summary, exposure, and global submissions."}, {"source_id": "src_fda_qfitlia_approval", "title": "FDA Approves Novel Treatment for Hemophilia A or B, with or without Factor Inhibitors", "url": "https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-approves-novel-treatment-hemophilia-or-b-or-without-factor-inhibitors", "publisher": "U.S. Food and Drug Administration", "document_date": "2025-03-28", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "regulator", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "FDA approval of Qfitlia, Alnylam-partnered fitusiran."}, {"source_id": "src_sanofi_qfitlia", "title": "Qfitlia approved as the first therapy in the US to treat hemophilia A or B with or without inhibitors", "url": "https://www.sanofi.com/en/media-room/press-releases/2025/2025-03-28-20-07-38-3051637", "publisher": "Sanofi", "document_date": "2025-03-28", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "partner_company_release", "availability": "available", "reliability": "medium", "notes": "Partner disclosure that Qfitlia uses Alnylam ESC-GalNAc conjugate technology."}, {"source_id": "src_neJM_helios_b_pubmed", "title": "Vutrisiran in Patients with Transthyretin Amyloidosis with Cardiomyopathy", "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39213194/", "publisher": "New England Journal of Medicine / PubMed", "document_date": "2025-01-02", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "academic_clinical_trial", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "Primary clinical publication record for HELIOS-B."}, {"source_id": "src_acc_helios_b", "title": "HELIOS-B: Vutrisiran Lowers Risk of CV Events and Death in Patients With ATTR-CM", "url": "https://www.acc.org/latest-in-cardiology/articles/2024/08/28/19/41/fri-647am-helios-b-esc-2024", "publisher": "American College of Cardiology", "document_date": "2024-08-30", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "medical_society", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "Trial design and headline clinical interpretation."}, {"source_id": "src_pubmed_rnai_natbiotech", "title": "RNA interference in the era of nucleic acid therapeutics", "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38409587/", "publisher": "Nature Biotechnology / PubMed", "document_date": "2024-03", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "academic_review", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "Alnylam-authored field review on RNAi medicines, delivery, and extrahepatic challenges."}, {"source_id": "src_pubmed_rnai_design", "title": "RNAi-based drug design: considerations and future directions", "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38570694/", "publisher": "Nature Reviews Drug Discovery / PubMed", "document_date": "2024-04", "accessed_at": "2026-05-12", "source_type": "academic_review", "availability": "available", "reliability": "high", "notes": "University of Massachusetts Chan Medical School review by Qi Tang and Anastasia Khvorova."}, {"source_id": "src_pubmed_systematic_2023", "title": "25 years of maturation: A systematic review of RNAi in the clinic", "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37583575/", "publisher": "Molecular T